{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36626","headline":"送内使周大夫自杭州朝贡 · 罗隐","name":"送内使周大夫自杭州朝贡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八都上将近平戎，便附輶轩奏圣聪。\n三接驾前朝觐礼，一函江表战征功。\n云间阆苑何时见，水底瑶池触处通。\n知有殿庭余力在，莫辞消息寄西风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}